[
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Group</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">to_additive</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">to_additive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">attr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to_fun</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"bp\">⁻¹</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simpa</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: @[to_additive] failed to add declaration `Function.bar_add`.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  The translated value is not type correct.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  For help, see the docstring of `to_additive`, section `Troubleshooting`.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">Application type mismatch: The argument</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  inst✝</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">has type</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  AddGroup M</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">but is expected to have type</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  Group M</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">in the application</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  @FooMul.fun_inv α M inst✝</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">to_additive</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bar_mul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">⁻¹</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fun_inv</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">to_additive</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inv'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">⁻¹</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inv</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- this works:</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">to_additive</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bar_mul'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FooMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">⁻¹</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inv'</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>It looks like what is produced by <code>to_fun</code> is confusing <code>to_additive</code>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Is this a known problem?</li>\n<li>Is there a work-around (other than writing out the <code>fun</code> version by hand)?</li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 576955351,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Stoll",
        "timestamp": 1772538458
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>yeah you have to tag <code>attribute [to_additive existing] Function.FooMul.fun_inv</code></p>",
        "id": 576964215,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1772541381
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Indeed getting <code>@[to_additive (attr := to_fun)]</code> to work correctly is still a TODO. In the meantime, you should be able to use <code>@[to_fun (attr := to_additive)]</code> to get the correct behaviour.</p>\n<p>(And <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"816344\">Aaron Liu</span> 's suggestion also works)</p>",
        "id": 577095842,
        "sender_full_name": "Jovan Gerbscheid",
        "timestamp": 1772581002
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I've now made <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36305\">#36305</a> which makes <code>to_additive (attr := to_fun)</code> work out of the box.</p>",
        "id": 577897223,
        "sender_full_name": "Jovan Gerbscheid",
        "timestamp": 1772875117
    }
